window.products.push({"id":604005,"name":"Cr Sleep Comfort Memory Foam Hybrid Mattress, 13'' H, Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61otqclKChL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"COMFORT&RELAX MEMORY FOAM 13 INCH HYBRID MATTRESS The mattress provides the ultimate in comfort by cleverly moulding around your body's contours. The technology is great for people with back problems as it supports the spine in perfect alignment. The foam core also reduces tossing and turning, eliminates motion transfer, and provides a great nights sleep. The mattress is designed to provide excellent support for all sleep positions including side, back and stomach sleepers. Our ventilated gel memory foam top layer features a breathable, advanced open-cell design to increase circulation and keep you cool. Air can pass freely beneath your body, even when the material contours to your curves. You will sleep more deeply and wake up feeling refreshed. 13\" DEEP LAYERS: *Layer One: 2\" Blue Gel Memory Foam provides better ventilation and disperses body pressure - Keep you cool *Layer Two: 1.5\" Pressure Relieving Comfort Foam provide additional body conforming comfort *Layer Three: 7.5\" Pocked Coil Base prevents motion transfer *Layer Four: 1\" High Density Support Base Foam for ultimate support base *Layer Five: 1\" Premier Support Latex Base Outer Cover: Poly-Jacquard fabric cover with angle wrapped Inner cover: Fire Barrier Lining (Flame-Retardant Effect) Certified Safe The foam used in this mattress is CertiPUR-US certified, which means the foam has been independently tested for safety of materials used, physical performance and environmental stewardship. Careful construction guarantees no prohibited phthalates, no ozone depleters, no CFCs, no mercury, no formaldehyde, no PBDEs, and low emission (VOCs) for indoor air quality. Smartly Shipped - The mattress si efficiently compressed, rolled and shipped in a box conveniently to your door. 20-Year Warranty For sleeping better experience, choose a memory foam mattress today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61otqclKChL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cr","source_asin":"B01J0QZ1SU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-604005","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01J0QZ1SU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01J0QZ1SU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
