window.products.push({"id":604036,"name":"WEST X ZEN Tea Cup with Infuser and Lid, 11 oz, Ceramic Mugs with Tea Infusers for Loose Tea, Strainer Pottery Mug, Microwave and Dishwasher Safe, Por","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QVfBKoyOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make Loose Leaf Tea Time More Enjoyable & Simple With Our Japanese Tea Cup with Infuser!  We designed our minimal mug to provide you with a simple and stylish way to brew your favorite tea at home, in the office, or on the go. It’s suitable for brewing all kinds of tea and for enjoying a wide variety of drinks while adding a decorative touch to your space.  Our tea and coffee mug with lid comes with an easy-to-use strainer that makes it a breeze to brew tea. It features a dense mesh that prevents tea leaves from passing through making it ideal for steeping most teas including green, black, chai, white, oolong, etc. It also makes a great hand warmer mug.  Quality Ceramic Craftsmanship & Functional Design – The unique pottery mugs are the perfect gift for any occasion!  When it comes to quality, we don’t make any exceptions. WEST X ZEN Japanese Tea Cups with Infuser and Lids are made using durable ceramic that’s sturdy enough for everyday use while the solid handle stays cool to touch so you can enjoy drinking tea comfortably.  Besides being the perfect addition to your daily routine, our charming tea mug infuser and lid make the perfect gift set for friends and family on any occasion you have in mind. They make the ideal Christmas Gift, Housewarming Gift, Anniversary Gift, Birthday Gift, etc.  Features You’ll Love: - It’s microwave safe so you can quickly heat up any drink - The clay tea cup is made of ceramic and filters out tea residue - Dishwasher safe and hand washable for quick cleanups - The handle provides a secure and comfortable grip when drinking - Our strainer does not affect the flavor or aroma of your tea in any way, no metallic taste!  Pour, Sip & Enjoy Your Favorite Tea Anytime & Anywhere With The WEST X ZEN Japanese Mug!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QVfBKoyOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WEST X ZEN","source_asin":"B08WQ9JQPY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-604036","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08WQ9JQPY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08WQ9JQPY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":604037,"name":"Armory Replicas David Dundee Sportsmans Crocodile-named Hunting Knife","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kR35KMVzL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"This Crocodile knife is sharper than a razor with the two-angle blade edge. The stainless steel blade is 9.3 inches long. The forward end of the spine is tapered, allowing more piercing power. Seven serrations are featured on the spine to further extend the wide range of uses for this knife. It makes a perfect camping knife and is large enough to complete heavy tasks. A wide, steel hand guard is implemented on the knife for protection of your second most valuable survival tool, the hand (second only to the brain). Natural carved wood is riveted to the blade tang. The wood grip feels very natural when holding the knife. Four finger grooves will provide you with tight grip on the knife. The pommel is steel, satin finished. It has the weight of a high class knife, but is agile like an artistic tool. You can find more and more uses for this knife every time you use it. A thick nylon sheath is included. The sheath has a stiff frame with a belt loop fastened at the core. Since it's first inception in the 1800's, the bowie-patterned knife has been very formidable in all situations, including fights. It was made famous after a fight between a famous man with the same last name as the blade pattern, and several other men. His unique knife style/pattern was partially to credit for his survival. Several variations have been developed since, providing wide support for the blade format.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kR35KMVzL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Armory Replicas","source_asin":"B00ZYK6KCI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-604037","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ZYK6KCI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ZYK6KCI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
