window.products.push({"id":604129,"name":"OurWay Beeswax Wraps 3 Piece Reusable Food Storage (Green Apples)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91TixBkcaML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"OurWay Wraps are made from organic cotton infused with jojoba oil and our signature beeswax blend. These reusable wraps are a great alternative to plastic film, helping your food stay fresh. OurWay Wraps can be used up to 12 months and when it comes time to dispose of them, our biodegradable wraps can be placed in your compost or trash. Easy to use: The warmth of your hands will soften the wrap and create the seal. Once cooled, OurWay Beeswax Wraps will maintain their shape. Cleaning: Hand-Wash in cool water ONLY with mild detergent. Air-dry or pat with a dry towel. Reusable: Our wraps may last up to 12 months when used and cared for as recommended. Warning: Keep OurWay Beeswax Wraps away from all hot surfaces such as ovens, microwaves, dishwashers, or hot liquids. Do not clean in washing machines. Do not use on raw meat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91TixBkcaML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OurWay","source_asin":"B0788F81Q6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-604129","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0788F81Q6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0788F81Q6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
