window.products.push({"id":604139,"name":"FORLIM Rechargeable Salt and Pepper Grinder Set with Charging Base, Automatic Electric Pepper Mill, Adjustable Coarseness, Auto Dust Lids + LED Light,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qJ5afTToL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👍[Upgrade Large Capacity]: Upgrade your spice grinding game with our electric grinder's impressive 2.5oz/70g capacity - that's 39% more space than the average grinder! Say goodbye to constant refilling and hello to a world of culinary convenience. With this upgraded capacity, you can now store more of your favorite spices and take your cooking to the next level. Don't settle for less, elevate your spice game with ease! 👍[USB Rechargeable]: Say goodbye to the hassle of replacing batteries with our electric grinder's USB rechargeable feature. Our grinder comes equipped with (2) 3.7V 500mAh lithium batteries and a convenient Type-C cable, allowing you to recharge it anywhere and anytime. Plus, with several weeks of cordless grinding on a single charge, you'll save time and money while elevating your culinary game at home, outdoors, or while on-the-go. Get ready to take your spice grinding experience to the next level! 👍[Gravity Grinder with Enhanced Safety Features]: Worried about accidental spills or starting the grinder by mistake? Our electric grinder features gravity-sensing technology and a safety switch that prevent it from turning on when dropped, tipped over, or mishandled, ensuring worry-free operation and minimizing messes. 👍[Auto LED Light & Auto Dust Lids]: The built-in LED light turns on automatically when the grinder is in use, illuminating your food and providing clear visibility of your seasoning for accurate flavoring, even in low-light conditions. The self-opening and closing dust lids keep your countertop clean from dust and debris, making it easy to use with just one hand. 👍[Grind Faster & Adjustable Coarseness]: Our FORLIM Electric Salt and Pepper Grinder is designed to grind your spices faster and smoother than other grinders. It can grind up to 0.2 oz in just 1 minute, which is 100% faster than similar grinders that can only make 0.1 oz. Moreover, the adjustable coarseness lets you customize the fineness of your seasoning from fine to coarse, depending on your preferences and recipes. 👍[Easy to Clean]: Our grinder also features a side-opening storage compartment for easy cleaning with the included brush, these features make the FORLIM Electric Salt and Pepper Grinder a must-have tool for any food lover and home cook. Note: Do not use water to wash, to avoid motor damage. 👍[200% Quality Guarantee & Money-Back]: We are confident in the quality of our product and offer a 90-day free replacement and money-back guarantee if you are not satisfied. In the rare event that you encounter a problem with the mill upon arrival, it may be due to granules getting stuck in the ceramic grinding core. To resolve this issue, simply adjust the top button to the coarsest setting and the blocked particles will fall out, allowing the mill to function properly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qJ5afTToL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FORLIM","source_asin":"B0BFCDHCVN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-604139","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFCDHCVN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFCDHCVN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
