window.products.push({"id":604169,"name":"Hentl 12\" x 12\" Peel and Stick Tiles Self-Adhesive Vinyl Mosaic Stick Tile for Kitchen Backsplash Grey-Black (6 Tiles)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WzXML0JJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The quality self adhesive wall tile that is easy to install for your kitchen or bathroom. Do it yourself! Just peel and stick! The DIY peel and stick tile very easy to cut, stick and maintain. Instantly protect your walls by taking a few minutes to install our innovative self adhesive wall tile. They are incredibly easy to apply on your wall in the kitchen or the bathroom because the application process requires absolutely no grouting or special hardware. Insatllation:  1. Clean and dry the surface,please noted don't have duty or oil in the surface.  2. Draw a leveled guide line.(If needed,cut the tile)  3. Remove the plastic protector on the back of the tile,ensure that the adhesive remains untouched.  4. Align the adhesive tile and install the tile.  Kindly Remind:  1) Some special surface are not suitable to install.Such as porous wood, embossed ceramic tiles and textured wallpaper.  2) Use the 3m spray adhesive to the surface before install and it works better.  3) The new arrived peel and stick tile may have little gel smell. The smell will dispel in 2-3 days.  4) If you want to remove the tile, you could use a hair dryer to warm up the adhesive and pull softly starting with the corners.Then use a cleaning product to remove the excess glue left by the peel and stick tile.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WzXML0JJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hentl","source_asin":"B01LXTZA0C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-604169","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LXTZA0C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LXTZA0C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":604170,"name":"VANZAVANZU Upgraded Cozy Weighted Blanket 15 lbs Twin Size 48\"x72\" for Kids and Adults 130-170 lbs with 100% Breathable Cotton and Premium Glass Beads","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FlXA73BxL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","description":"Cotton 🏠 RESTFUL WEIGHTED BLANKET : VANZAVANZU weighted blanket simulates deep pressure touch of being hugged by a cuddly & secure swaddle. The sensation helps to get sleepers relax and encourage a quicker & deeper grounding and wake up refreshed for a productive new day. 🏠 CHOOSE WEIGHT & SIZE : Choose the blanket that weighs about 10% of your body weight, 48\"x72\" weighted blanket 15 lbs is suitable for 130-170 lbs individual and a twin or queen or king size bed. The size only covers the body, not the bed. When using with children or seniors, ensure the individual has enough strength to move the blanket off themselves if necessary. Note: 48''x72'' maybe not long enough for people tall than 5'5\" and narrow for those flop frequently on bed. 🏠 LEAKAGE-PROOF & DURABLE : High density cotton shell, tight stitching, durable quilting thread and well-made edges completely bring you a durable and leakage-proof weighted blanket for long time use. No fray up or leakage of glass beads. 🏠 EVENLY DISTRIBUTED & COZY WEIGHTED BLANKET : The non-toxic & refined glass beads are evenly dispersed and tightly sewed in multiple sturdy compartments of 6''x6''. Durable stitching prevents leakage, sliding from one to another and clumping. Scientific 7 layers and more weight & less fabric design constructs sleepers with moderate weight, body-hugging comfort without feeling the beads bulging through and balanced temperature control. 🏠 VERSATILE & WASHABLE BLANKET : Cuddling our cotton weighted blanket up for a restful nap or snuggling on sofa for your favorite TV show. Easy care and machine washable. Recommend to use with our removable duvet cover for longer lifespan. GUARANTEE: 365 days’ Customer Satisfaction Promise. If you have any issue about our products or service, don’t hesitate to contact us for a satisfying solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FlXA73BxL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VANZAVANZU","source_asin":"B07M7N9J5N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-604170","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07M7N9J5N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07M7N9J5N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
