window.products.push({"id":604234,"name":"Flash Furniture Mindy Kids Black Folding Table","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.6,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xMdD8nt2L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"On the hunt for a multipurpose table for your growing toddler? This kid size folding table is perfect for snack time, arts & crafts, learning and reading. This kid dining room table can be placed next to the main dining table for everyone to enjoy meals as a family while allowing young kids to become more independent. Safety measure in place to keep the table from collapsing on children; push in lever to unlock, then fold. This table makes the perfect activity table with its easy to clean vinyl covering that is perfect for the playroom. Sized for shared spaces in the kitchen, bedroom or kid's playroom, this toddler table will be their special little table for everything. You won't be disappointed in the joy that you'll bring to your little lady or little man by presenting them with their very own folding table.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xMdD8nt2L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flash Furniture","source_asin":"B07ZV23687","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-604234","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZV23687","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZV23687","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":604235,"name":"Jet Creations Giant Inflatable Blowup Animal Party Decoration: Realistic American Bald Eagle, Size 38 inch, Air Stuffed Animal, Party Favors for Kids,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.75,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nMyJ9TBIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERFECT INDOOR OR OUTDOOR PARTY DECORATIONFrom birthday parties to 4TH of July holiday parties to animal parties, let your indoor or outdoor events fly high with this giant American Bald Eagle inflatable animal party decoration. Hang this party animal anywhere with the included hang tags to help your event soar to new heights. Let it hang in the background as a decoration in your home or backyard or fly into action as a toy, a party favor, or a holiday gift. A wildly good time is sure to be had when this fun giant blowup animal decoration is around. EASY TO INFLATE & DEFLATEEasily inflate this fun and realistic-looking American Bald Eagle party decoration in about a minute. Inflate by mouth or use a hand pump. The check valve makes it simple to inflate without air escaping. Open the cap of the valve and start adding air. The check valve ensures that air will not rush out when you pull your mouth or the pump away from the check valve. To quickly deflate, pull out the check valve to allow air to freely flow out from the inflatable. Once deflated, fold for easy storage all year long. GIANT FUNBring BIG fun to your home, backyard, classroom, dorm, or office. When fully inflated, this inflatable American Bald Eagle’s wingspan is approximately 3.1 feet (38”) wide and measures 2 feet (25”) long. When deflated, it’s small, compact, and easy to travel with allowing you to bring the fun anywhere. From its curved beak to its expansive wings to its talons, this realistic-looking American Bald Eagle inflatable party decoration is sure to attract attention and bring joy to all who interact with it. An ideal decoration for outdoor parties, backyard camping, indoor gatherings, or holidays. A perfect gift for any animal lover. BUILT TO LASTThis giant inflatable animal decoration was built to last and stand the test of time.  Made of heavy-duty vinyl that withstands daily wear and tear, internal reinforcements have been added to provide extra durability. This large inflatable is phthalate-free and is made in a facility that complies with US/EU safety and quality standards. Jet Creations tests all inflatable products for an extensive period of time before they are packed and shipped to ensure quality. Includes repair kit. Safe for children ages 6+.COLLECT THEM ALLCollect all of Jet Creations’ giant inflatable animals from inflatable zoo animals to inflatable jungle safari animals to giant inflatable dinosaurs! What You Got: Inflatable Eagle x1Copyright Jet Creations. All rights reserved.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nMyJ9TBIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jet Creations","source_asin":"B07T326V3W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-604235","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T326V3W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07T326V3W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
