window.products.push({"id":604266,"name":"Hmtoperyd Lemon Squeezer Lime, Citrus Juicer Tool Lemon Juicer Squeezer Hand-squeezing Citrus Lemon Clip Hand Manual Lemon Squeezers-lime Metal Squeez","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51accZ9g4jL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【High Quality Material】Thickened zinc alloy material is healthy and eco-friendly. Hmtoperyd lemon squeezer lime is sturdy, non-magnetic and anti-corrosive. Product weight is 400g, which is durable enough for long-term use. 【Convenient Operate】 Juicing easily in 5 seconds, fast and easy to use. First cut the lemon in half, put half of the lemon face down in the lemon squeezer, then start juicing. Simple operation, even children can make a glass of pure juice in a few minutes. It can also be easily used by arthritis people. 【Large Size & High Efficiency】 In order to bring you a unique and perfect experience, we put a lot of effort into product size. It not only has a long handle (9.1\" long), but also a large bowl (2.75\" in diameter), which can store larger oranges, reducing the trouble of cutting oranges or squeezing larger fruits. 【Easy to Clean and Store】After use, it can be washed directly in the dishwasher, or rinsed off with water to remove the residue on the surface. There is a hole design at the end of handle, which can be hung at well after cleaning. 【Unique Design】Hmtoperyd lemon clip has too many clever designs. The crimping groove design can increase the juice output by 10% and extract the juice more thoroughly. Stainless steel rivets are durable and not deformed. The uniform filter holes at the bottom make the juice flow smoothly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51accZ9g4jL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"hmtoperyd","source_asin":"B08GZGGL2F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-604266","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GZGGL2F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GZGGL2F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
