window.products.push({"id":604553,"name":"Heran Air Motorcycle Seat Cushion - 3D Motorcycle Seat Pad, Air Fillable Motorcycle Cushion, Shock Absorption Motorcycle Air Cushion for Cruiser Touri","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Zf1x5xT1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fitments: This motorcycle seat cushion fits Large Cruisers, Standards, Sports Touring, Adventure Touring. Such as R1200GS, Honda Hornet, VFR, CBF, Suzuki SV, Yamaha Spyder SM5 RS, Yamaha Ryker and many more Feature: The motorcycle air cushion is ergonomically designed to provide shock absorption and make you feel comfortable while riding. Inflatable cushion is an auxiliary tool to support the body. It can increase the compressed area of the body, reduce local postural pressure, reduce body fatigue, improve local supporting conditions, and prevent bedsores. In addition to aeration, it also innovatively uses a water injection design, which is specifically designed for long-distance driving/sedentary people. It has been found by experiments that it can effectively help to cool down and disperse heat, so that you can stay away from sweat.1.Unique multi-cell design for the ultimate in seating comfort and vibration absorption2.TPU fabrics has excellent elasticity and wear resistance. This material provides excellent performance under severe weather and manpower. Just take a rest after you arrive, it doesn't need frequent maintenance.3.Lycra diving elastic fabric feels delicate and soft, greatly improves the feel of the cushion and the recovery of crease. It's of high rebound, no deformation and can be repeatedly washed.4.In addition, by adding water to the motorcycle pad cushion, it will also help you cool down and dispense heat.5.With shallow groove design, you will stay cool even you have been sedentary. The 3D airbag gap can achieve excellent ventilation effect, so the cushion is comfortable and not sticky.6.We used anti-skid particles and double-bandage fixation. The bottom of the air motorcycle cushion is also designed with unique anti-slip particles. More restraint and stable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Zf1x5xT1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Heran","source_asin":"B09G2TK1XZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-604553","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09G2TK1XZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09G2TK1XZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
