window.products.push({"id":604616,"name":"LE TAUCI Spoon Rest for Kitchen Counter, Spoon Rest for Stove Top, Farmhouse Kitchen Decor, Ceramic Utensil Holder for Cooking, 5 Inches-Set of 1, Oys","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512IaGqneRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Cozy Home For Your Trustiest Spoon - 5.10 x 4.80 x 1.20 inches, Spoon rest is ideal for holding kitchen utensils of different sizes. Such as spoons, ladles, whisks, and tongs.This spoon holder makes it easy to catch water droplets and food debris on cutlery and keep your counter clean. A set of 4 pieces allows you to hold more than one container at a time without worrying about flavor. Careful Design - Deepened spoon walls to better prevent drips from spilling. Small, thoughtful openings around the edges hold the utensils in place so they can't roll around on the utensil holder. Slightly raised bottom edge reduces contact area with tabletop and does not create water stains on the table. Excellent Ceramic Material - Made of high quality ceramic, lead and cadmium free, no odor, no scratching or rusting. Has extremely high heat resistant properties and can be placed casually next to the stove without worrying if it melts. The weight of the ceramic provides stability, allows it to sit comfortably on your counter top and will not move easily when placing spoons. Reduce The Clutter And A Better Cooking Experience - The surface is covered with a smooth glaze and stains do not stay on the ceramic spoon rest. Dishwasher safe, making cleaning easier. Removed the spoon handle that could easily break, it is the ideal shape for holding spoons and ladles. Stackable and takes up little space. You can store it in the cabinet or place it on the kitchen counter as you wish. Spoon holder for stove top not bulky and will not detract from the look of your kitchen. Ideal Kitchen Decor - With its clean white glaze and simple text, it is a classic representation of the farmhouse style. This farmhouse spoon rest matches seamlessly with farmhouse kitchen accessories as well as other styles. When you’re not using cooking, leave it out as decor to style your counter tops. Our spoon rest for stove top is a great gift for Christmas, Wedding, Birthday Party, Mother's Day, Housewarming...","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512IaGqneRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LE TAUCI","source_asin":"B0C38P79NJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-604616","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C38P79NJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C38P79NJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
