window.products.push({"id":604629,"name":"Magnetic Picture Frames for Refrigerator 4x6 Inches - 12 Units of Black Magnetic Photo Frames with the Plastic Sleeves / Pockets for Your Pictures - U","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71flQfsMy4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Create Memorable Moments from Your Favorite Times! Sticky Shoot magnetic photo frames for the refrigerator (or any other metal surface) will make your day better. With the help of our popular magnet picture sleeves, you can save memories of your kids, grandchildren, life events, trips, birthdays, weddings, anniversaries, holidays, and more. It can even be used to hold coupons, cards, and invitations.Keep Your Pics Neat and Organized! Are you sick of seeing your pictures scattered around your floor with broken magnets? When you close the fridge door, the magnetic picture frame for the refrigerator won't fall off or be untidy like before; instead, they'll be sturdy and durable, making you happy every time you see your photos.Draw Attention to Your Photo, Not the Frame! Showcase the whole image without chopping off any details thanks to the solid black backing and narrow borders. Or add a bit of highlight around smaller sized photos. No matter how much money you spent on the frame, everyone recognizes that the actual value is what's in the photos!Stop Stressing Over Slamming the Fridge Door! These photo frames with full magnetic backing are slam-proof, so they won't fall from your refrigerator if the door is shut tightly. There is no need to be concerned with someone stepping on or knocking your pictures off.Suitable For Any Occasion! For birthdays, baby showers, weddings, house warmings, or even as a decoration for your own home, these incredible magnet photo frames are a fantastic gift. Want to enjoy the view of your beautiful, clutter-free refrigerator? Go ahead and press the orange “Add to cart” button at the top and jazz up your fridge with the best memories!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71flQfsMy4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sticky Shoot","source_asin":"B07XTD3D8P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-604629","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XTD3D8P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XTD3D8P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
