window.products.push({"id":604644,"name":"Cambom Rotary Cheese Grater Round Mandoline Slicer with 3 Interchangeable Blades, Manual Vegetable Food Shredder with Strong Suction Base by Cambom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617WLmlgoBL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"🍒Safe Rotary Cheese Grater: Vegetable slicer blades are made from high quality stainless steel, other parts of the rotary graterare made from food grade BPA free plastic. No need electricity, inter blades and no contacting blades with hand. 🍒Humanity Design Cheese Shredder Grater: A strong suction base grips securely to CLEAN and SMOOTH countertop for effortless chopping. The mandoline slicer sits diagonally, so the grated pieces fall out from vegetable grater shredder by themselves and make no clogging. 3 round sharp blades include a slicing blade, a coarse shredding blade and a fine shredding blade. 🍒Multiple Functions Hard Cheese Slicer: Hand crank cheese grater is great for cheese, vegetables, potatoes, nuts, onions for coleslaw, hash browns, salad, pizza toppings and more with this hand-powered rotary grater. 🍒Mamual and High Efficiently Nut Chopper: With this round cheese grater, you can get food preparation more efficiently with minimum effort. 360 degree roller cuts foods all the time when you crank the handle. Shaking 1 circle equals to cut 12 times. 🍒Space Saving and Easy Cleaning: Performs the tasks of multiple kitchen tools in one, this round cheese grater takes up a little cupboard and bench space. The food shredder slicer is easy to be disassembles for easy clean. You can just clean it under the running water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617WLmlgoBL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cambom","source_asin":"B0BX71B177","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-604644","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BX71B177","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BX71B177","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
