window.products.push({"id":604689,"name":"UpNUpCo Artistic and Colorful Kitchen Rugs Kitchen Mats for Floor Non Slip Kitchen Rugs and Mats Kitchen Mat Set Farmhouse Kitchen Rugs and Mats Kitch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91bbEPmnYLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ARTISTIC TOUCH! The kitchen is the center of a home full of life! Ensure to bring that liveliness, and brightness with our kitchen rug! Choose from a variety of professionally printed designs! Kitchen Rugs are made high quality with vibrant colors. Our two piece rug set fills the kitchen with energy! You will love washing dishes, baking, and cooking once you transform your kitchen. Fits perfectly with every kind of decor. The eyes of your guests will gravitate towards your decorative rugs! MULTIPLE SIZES & DESIGNS! The possibilities are endless with our 2 piece kitchen rugs. Bring your kitchen to life with a pop of color and design! Ranging from cute home goods, bright patterns, and funky designs. Your guests will be drawn in by the liveliness of your kitchen! The set comes with two pieces to create a cohesive environment! The non slip kitchen mat is both comfortable! Small cushion for comfort! Essential floor-mat for your home! EASY TO CLEAN & ABSORBENT! All of our mats are resistant from your everyday messes! We know in the kitchen your floors are prone to spilling and crumbs! That's why our mat is made of premium material to be machine washable while protecting your floors! Absorbs water and dries quickly! After awhile thrown into a washing machine to look brand new! A functional staple to lift your spirits! You cannot go wrong with our kitchen area rugs! NON-SLIP RESISTANT! The latex backing on each mat saves you time, hassle and money. The best quality latex in a specific pattern ensures a non-slip rug. The non-slip backing is already attached saving you the hassle of cutting and buying your own! Never worry about the rug slipping or dangers! No more pesky lopsided mat! Guaranteed to firmly stick in place! The mat plus non slip backing are thin enough to fit under doors as well! The non slip backing is easy to clean and will not scratch floors! U.S.A. Design and Testing: While our products are manufactured overseas (let's be honest, what isn't these days..) ALL of our DESIGN AND TESTING was done right here in the United States. Our USA customer service team stands by to provide you with exceptional, lightning quick responses to your every concern. Your satisfaction is our #1 priority.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91bbEPmnYLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UpNUpCo","source_asin":"B0B4W28MXB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-604689","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4W28MXB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4W28MXB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":604690,"name":"Bush Furniture Salinas Home Office Desk, 60W, Cape Cod Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51excPKDdiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Bush Furniture Salinas 60W Computer Desk with Storage offers a practical home office solution with casual farmhouse style. Take on your next project or assignment with a computer, books, paperwork and more on a durable work surface that supports up to 200 pounds. The desktop also includes a built-in wire management grommet to keep pesky cords and cables out of the way while you work. Save floor space in compact areas by placing the home office desk against a wall or make use of the finished back to take a prominent position facing out into the room. A convenient shelf pulls out for easy access to your keyboard or laptop while a small box drawer organizes writing utensils, notepads and other office supplies. The storage cabinet contains an adjustable shelf to accommodate items of various sizes. Salinas' mission-inspired styling includes tapered legs, curved base rails, decorative wood accents and Tumbled Pewter hardware. Find the perfect look for your home with slightly weathered Antique White, Cape Cod Gray and Vintage Black finish options. Complete your casual workspace with a Tufted Office Chair, Hutch, File Cabinet, Bookcase, Storage Cabinet and more (coordinating items sold separately). This farmhouse desk with storage has been tested to meet ANSI/SOHO quality standards for safety and performance and is backed by the Bush Furniture 1 Year Manufacturer's Warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51excPKDdiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bush Furniture","source_asin":"B096TJ1RZB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-604690","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096TJ1RZB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096TJ1RZB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":604691,"name":"Bonnecaze & Cie Long Absinthe Spoon No:2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/310aZ1K6Z3L._AC_.jpg","description":"Absinthe spoons have been around for hundreds of years. Originally invented in France and Switzerland the spoons were used to properly prepare one’s absinthe. An absinthe spoon is a perforated or slotted spoon that is used to dissolve a sugar cube in a glass of absinthe, usually to sweeten the drink and counteract its mild bitterness. The bowl of the spoon is normally flat, with a notch in the handle where it rests on the rim of the glass. Originating circa the 1860s, absinthe spoons were often stamped with brand names or logos as advertising, much like modern alcohol paraphernalia. Sometimes they were sold as tourist items; for example, some might be shaped like the Eiffel Tower, for example the spoon Eiffel Tower No:14, which was made for the inauguration of the building in the year 1889. Absinthe spoons also come shaped like ice tea spoons, these types are less traditional. These less common spoons normally have a spoon bowl (like a teaspoon) and a sugar holder built into the handle. With these spoons one must flip the spoon over and rest it on the glass, placing the sugar in the grill on the handle. Absinthe spoons are truly unique gift for anyone.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/310aZ1K6Z3L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bonnecaze & Cie","source_asin":"B002EL3VJK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-604691","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002EL3VJK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002EL3VJK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
