window.products.push({"id":604885,"name":"MIKOSI 3 in 1 Portable Air Conditioner Fan, Personal Small Evaporative Air Cooler Humidifier Misting Fan with LED Light, Rechargeable Battery for Room","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kKnTf9suS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【Portable Evaporative Air conditioner Fan】3 in 1 Portable Evaporative Air Cooler Fan integrates desk fan, mist humidifier, and LED light in one. Unlike traditional fans and AC units, MIKOSI Portable air cooler moisture to the air to prevent your skin, eyes, and nasal passages from drying out. The small portable air conditioner is made of ABS+PP. Some of its most attractive and competitive features include the fact that it is eco-friendly, quiet, has an enhanced leak-proof system. 【400mL Water Tank& High Capacity Battery 】Air cooler with Built-in High capacity rechargeable battery runs up to 6 hours, it also supports USB charging like via a power bank. Personal air condiction with a large water tank, easy to add ice water from the top and check the capacity from the visible tank window, if full-filled, lasts up to 12 hours, frees you from refilling water frequently. 【Easy to Use Air Conditioner Portable】The portable ac air conditioner has an easy-to-use control panel, just fill the water tank and press the ON button to start. The mini air conditioner wind speed adjustment and a variable louver ensure you can optimize your personal cooling preferences. You can also adjust the LED light. Any of them can be used as your small soft night light to take care of you or your family warmly when you fall asleep or wake up at night. Energy-Saving and Lightweight】MIKOSI personal air conditioner mini portable just offer an eco-friendly and cost-effective way to cool spaces. Personal air cooler with a power consumption of only 4.5W saves your electricity bills and does no harm to the environment. Cordless, compact(9 x 4.5 x 6in), lightweight(1.8lb), and quiet. The portable ac air conditioner come with you wherever you go. 【MIKOSI Guarantee】Please rest assured to use MIKOSI small air conditioner fan, if there is any quality problem, we can refund unconditionally within 36 months. The product uses touch buttons with a waterproof design. Customers who cannot turn on the buttons due to the different pressing habits of each person, please use them patiently. If you have any operational problems, please feel free to contact us and we will be at your service 24 hours a day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kKnTf9suS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIKOSI","source_asin":"B09B8RNGJT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-604885","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B8RNGJT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B8RNGJT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
