window.products.push({"id":604942,"name":"MEEDEE Blue and White Stripe Ribbon Blue White Ribbon Blue Wired Ribbon 2.5 Inch Light Blue Burlap Ribbon with Ivory Stripe Edge Blue Wired Christmas ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61i40gQpViL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💎 Rustic linen and delicate double color striped wired ribbon combine to create this simple yet elegant ribbon. This gorgeous blue ribbon measures 2-1/2 inch wide by 10 yards long, approx. 30 feet. This blue ribbon wired with ivory colored edges can be utilized in a variety of ways to accent your baby shower décor, nautical décor, winter blue décor or wedding décor. 💘 Burlap woven ribbon is a durable fabric trim which is stiffer than normal ribbon. The premium quality and color is perfect for accent pieces for todays modern farmhouse trend. Wired edges make it easy to manipulate and create intricate bows to add an ultra-feminine touch. Utilize this wired craft ribbon to rekindle the creative spirit! 💎 Looking for a pretty wired wide ribbon that oozes rustic charm? This is it! A tricolor woven burlap ribbon with blue stripe in a natural faux linen texture, with an ivory threading wired edge. This wonderful blue stripe ribbon is sure to take over your home decor, as it is both beautiful and classy. Wrap jars, chairs, railings, crafting, decorating, wreath creation, floral arrangements, hair bows and more. Great ribbon for all crafters to have on hand. 💙 Baby blue and ivory colors make this pattern a classic and elegant way to add holiday spirit. It really is lovely and would add the finishing touch to your projects. Add the perfect finishing touch to a carefully chosen gift with luxury wrapping paper and gift tags and crafts ribbon. Sewn wire edged allows you to bend and shape your creations to decorate a tree topper, wrapping the holiday gifts, wedding favors, stunning on your mailbox, swags, staircase or centerpieces... 💌 Please note: A slight color difference may occur due to the lighting on the camera, iPhone, computer screen and the sensitivity of the ribbon fabric. If our product does not meet your expectations, can 100% refund of your purchase price. Happy Crafting!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61i40gQpViL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MEEDEE","source_asin":"B0BVJ8K3BG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-604942","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVJ8K3BG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVJ8K3BG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
